WEBVTT

00:05:27.665 --> 00:05:30.228
they work together
and with others in the industry

00:05:30.252 --> 00:05:32.172
to solve shared problems.

00:05:33.149 --> 00:05:36.602
They take responsibility for things
that happen upstream as well.

00:05:37.395 --> 00:05:38.561
Around the world,

00:05:38.585 --> 00:05:43.252
there are around 300 million people
who work from home in this industry,

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:44.855
most of them women,

00:05:44.879 --> 00:05:47.680
many of them in very
difficult circumstances

00:05:47.704 --> 00:05:49.252
with poor lighting,

00:05:49.276 --> 00:05:52.609
sewing on buttons
and doing detailed stitching.

00:05:53.117 --> 00:05:57.434
Until 2014, there was no protection
for these workers.

00:05:58.101 --> 00:06:02.212
A group of companies got together
with a not-for-profit called Nest